      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あの時のCDショップから、仕事の依頼？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "鷹城 恭二"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_d:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はい！　店員さんが皆さんの対応に、\nとても感動したそうで……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_d:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "上司の方にかけあって、\nお仕事をくださったんです！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_d:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おー！　それじゃ、\nあの時の店員さん、また笑顔にできる？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_d:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ふふ、俺たちが頑張れば、きっと出来るよ。\nそれで、お仕事の内容は？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_d:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はい。一日店長と、\n店内放送をお願いしたいそうです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_d:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "店内、放送……？\n恭二たちはやったこと、ある？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_d:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いや……俺はコンビニ店内の\n呼びかけくらいしか経験ないな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "鷹城 恭二"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_d:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺も似たようなものかなぁ。\n花屋の留守電で使うメッセージの録音くらいだよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_d:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_d",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_d.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うーん……ボクも、よくわからない。\nでも、店内放送のお仕事、やりたい……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
